fexdroid (local, never upstreamed): thunkgen builds with clang/LLVM 23.

clang 23 removed clang::FileManager::clearStatCache(); skip the call there (the stat
cache it cleared no longer exists). Build-host only: thunkgen runs on the PC.
---
diff --git a/ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp b/ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp
index ccc7cbc..90e9c61 100644
--- a/ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp
+++ b/ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp
@@ -840,6 +840,8 @@ bool GenerateThunkLibsActionFactory::runInvocation(std::shared_ptr<clang::Compil
 
   const bool Success = Compiler.ExecuteAction(Action);
 
+#if LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR < 23 // fexdroid: clang 23 dropped the FileManager stat cache
   Files->clearStatCache();
+#endif
   return Success;
 }
